Meridian Trust Bank
Q3 Service Recovery Review

Scope
- Review branch incidents with elevated severity and confirm whether the follow-up met response expectations.
- Compare incident timing, SLA performance, and balance movement in the affected branch and period.

Working guidance
- Use main.ops_branch.branch_incidents for the canonical incident record.
- Use main.ops_branch.service_sla_events for response and resolution timing.
- Use main.finance_core.deposit_balances when checking whether service pressure overlapped with balance movement.

Review note
- Branch incident counts alone are not enough for the service-impact question. SLA and balance context should be checked together.